    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `normalize_expense.py` that normalizes extracted expense fields into a standard JSON schema using an external provider, I will choose AWS Lambda as the external provider. AWS Lambda is a serverless computing service that allows you to run code without provisioning or managing servers. I will use the `boto3` library to interact with AWS Lambda, which will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
